WEBVTT

1
00:00:01,840 --> 00:00:03,640
Young man, why are you still here?

2
00:00:03,640 --> 00:00:04,840
are you drunk

3
00:00:04,840 --> 00:00:06,240
Hey, where are your friends?

4
00:00:06,240 --> 00:00:08,240
Auntie, I work here

5
00:00:08,240 --> 00:00:09,640
So you work here?

6
00:00:09,640 --> 00:00:11,640
Everyone is off work now. Why don't you leave?

7
00:00:11,640 --> 00:00:13,640
It's almost dawn so quickly

8
00:00:13,640 --> 00:00:16,580
Okay, then I'm leaving, Brother Chen

9
00:00:16,580 --> 00:00:17,780
Is Mr. Lu there?

10
00:00:17,780 --> 00:00:19,380
Salary, right? I'll transfer the money to you.

11
00:00:19,380 --> 00:00:21,580
I can't use that, can you give me cash?

12
00:00:21,580 --> 00:00:24,160
Thank you Brother Chen

13
00:00:24,160 --> 00:00:25,560
That matter was handled well last night

14
00:00:25,560 --> 00:00:27,960
Mr. Lu is quite satisfied and will come next time.

15
00:00:27,960 --> 00:00:38,450
I'll come to you right away

16
00:00:38,450 --> 00:00:47,400
Does uncle still know me?

17
00:00:47,400 --> 00:00:49,000
I've come to you before to sell junk.

18
00:00:49,000 --> 00:00:50,600
I heard that you have always wanted to rent out this yard.

19
00:00:50,600 --> 00:00:51,600
You don’t want to do it anymore, right?

20
00:00:51,600 --> 00:00:54,000
Now I, Brother Xiao, want to rent your yard. What do you think of renting it?

21
00:00:54,000 --> 00:00:56,000
Yes, I want to rent your yard

22
00:00:56,000 --> 00:00:57,400
rent my yard
